    <comment>From @adamm:

&gt; git push -&gt; pushes to gitea, triggers OBS service to sync to OBS internal sources. Depending on load in OBS source service, can take anywhere from seconds to sometimes rarely hours (because OBS was restrating or something)

So, when I run:

```
$ git push
$ osc sr openSUSE:Factory
```

I get old revision. Lovely.</comment>
